[0.001, "o", "\u001b[31;1H\u001b[0;1;7mmanifests/rayjob.yaml [+]                                                                             60,25          Bot\u001b[0m"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[26;1H\u001b[0;37;40m╭─ \u001b[0;1;33;40m▶ lines 54–60\u001b[0;37;40m ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\u001b[0m"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[27;1H\u001b[0;37;40m│\u001b[0;40m \u001b[1mGRPO\u001b[0;40m is just an algorithm for turning rewards into weight updates (Slime also has PPO, GSPO, CISPO, REINFORCE++). It \u001b[0;37;40m│\u001b[0m"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[28;1H\u001b[0;37;40m│\u001b[0;40m \u001b[0;40mscores each trajectory against its group's mean and spread; above-average ones become more likely. No critic model   \u001b[0;37;40m│\u001b[0m"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[29;1H\u001b[0;37;40m│\u001b[0;40m \u001b[0;40mneeded.                                                                                                              \u001b[0;37;40m│\u001b[0m"]
