[0.0, "o", "  \u001b[1mROLLOUT\u001b[0m      \u001b[0;37mDynamo serves every turn of the step's 256 trajectories on vN, and reward_func scores each one.\u001b[0m\r\n               \u001b[0;37mNo model loading here. It ends with the slowest trajectory. Requests per trajectory: turns, averaged.\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1mTRAIN\u001b[0m        \u001b[0;37mThe job from Steps 4–5 at work: Megatron-LM turns the 256 scored trajectories into one GRPO update.\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1mWEIGHT SYNC\u001b[0m  \u001b[0;37mThe trainer writes vN+1 to Lustre (write); the 4 engines pause, load it, and resume (load).\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
